  "name": "@cortex-docs/mcp-gen",
  "readme": "# @cortex-docs/mcp-gen\n\n`@cortex-docs/mcp-gen` creates Model Context Protocol servers from API specifications and project documentation.\n\nMost users install [`@cortex-docs/cli`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@cortex-docs/cli) instead of this package.\n\nRead the [Cortex Docs repository](https://github.com/cortex-docs/cortex) for usage and contribution information.\n",
